OL,3,GNEWSAFewer people moving to NI as
OL,4,Afigures decline sharply
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational migration to Northern
OL,7,FIreland declined sharply in 2025, new
OL,8,Fofficial figures suggest.
OL,10,FThere were an estimated 12,100
OL,11,Finternational arrivals while 10,200
OL,12,Fpeople left giving a net gain of 1,900
OL,13,Fpeople.
OL,15,FExcluding the pandemic year of 2020, it
OL,16,Fwas the lowest level of international
OL,17,Fimmigration in more than a decade.
OL,19,FIt compares to a recent peak of net
OL,20,Finternational immigration of almost
OL,21,F9,000 people in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
